{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "会场里有个抱着贝斯的女孩",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.first",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "创作者集会。展位一间挨一间，空气里混着纸和咖啡的味道。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（いろんなクリエイターが集まるイベントか……）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（ここでスカウト、ってことはないと思うけど。何か面白いものに出会えるだろうか）",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "text": "角落里，一个抱着贝斯的女孩正在发传单。接过去的人不多。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（ん……あの子、楽器を抱えてるな。出展者……いや、ライブパフォーマンスの出演者かな）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（それにしては、ずいぶんあどけないような……）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "text": "目光对上了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……もしかして、ライブパフォーマンスに出演する方ですか？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "是……！　是的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "我之后就要上台，请一定来看",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢……！──传单也做得很好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "真的吗？我改了好多遍，听您这么说好开心",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，这是你自己做的？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "厉害啊……！你还要演奏吧。那是──",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "是贝斯。虽然还很生疏──",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "其实是朋友说少一个人，把我叫去的……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "练了很久，今天是第一次上台",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……！为了朋友，很有胆量啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "呵呵～",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我是不是打扰到你上台前的集中了。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……没有，反而是您跟我说话，让我放松下来了",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "────这里的人，哪怕只有一个也好，会不会停下来听一听……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "会不会觉得开心呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "能不能打动某个人的心呢────",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────能不能打动，大概取决于你吧",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "比起去动那些动不了的心，不如先动你自己的心────把看得见的世界重新涂一遍就好",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "──────……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "text": "广播里在叫下一个出场者。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "啊……！不好意思，我差不多该走了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，加油……！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（有趣的孩子啊……也去看看她的舞台吧）",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（很神奇的孩子。明明是软软的可爱的样子……）",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（却像是在看着别的地方）",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………要不要去挖她呢"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
